# Derived from what is tracked, so none of it is. Each line names the source it comes from,
# because a generated file that gets committed is one somebody will later edit by hand and
# the edit will survive exactly until the next build.

# The doc gate is a mix application. Its build output, its one dev-only dependency and its
# dialyzer PLTs all come from mix.exs and mix.lock.
misc/checks/_build/
misc/checks/deps/
misc/checks/priv/plts/


# Finder writes one into every directory it is asked to display. It records icon positions on
# one machine and means nothing on any other, and `mix check` fails on one in any repository
# this project may write to -- so ignoring it here would hide what that gate exists to find.
# Listed to be explicit that it is not wanted, not to make it invisible.
.DS_Store

# Build and run output from a long engine build or a test server, worth keeping on disk while
# a session runs and not afterwards.
*.log
